### Créer un véhicule (1)
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Clio",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 80.0,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE"
}

